('advanced-native-1731', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1731-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["寫作經驗後，說話者理解例子作用並開始嘗試。"],"options":["作者只記住例子這個詞，還沒有把它與自己草稿連起。","寫作經驗後，說話者理解例子作用並開始嘗試。","說話者從未明白例子作用，仍只抄原有抽象段。","道理在第一句解釋前已被完整教過且熟練應用。"]},"advanced-native-1731-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The lesson sank in quietly, and I began choosing a concrete example first.","I understood why a clear moment could help more than another abstract paragraph.","The feedback started to make practical sense as I rewrote.","I moved from hearing the advice to trying it in my own draft."],"options":["The lesson sank in quietly, and I began choosing a concrete example first.","I understood why a clear moment could help more than another abstract paragraph.","The feedback started to make practical sense as I rewrote.","I moved from hearing the advice to trying it in my own draft."]},"advanced-native-1731-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The lesson is beginning to sink in through those attempts."],"options":["Repeating the words alone is described as complete understanding from the start.","The person now concentrates on reciting the rule more quickly, without rereading the actual question.","The lesson is beginning to sink in through those attempts."]},"advanced-native-1731-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只重複字句，仍說不出它與眼前事情的關係。"],"options":["某個意思經時間或經驗後變得明白。","只重複字句，仍說不出它與眼前事情的關係。","開始能解釋為何一條建議適用。"]},"advanced-native-1731-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The lesson sank in through revising; repeating the words earlier was not the same as understanding their use."],"options":["The lesson sank in through revising; repeating the words earlier was not the same as understanding their use.","Use my early recitation as the only evidence of how well I understood the advice.","Give me more abstract rules before asking what I noticed while revising the drafts."]},"advanced-native-1731-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["To see whether the rule has begun to sink in, could you expla