f the world if you cannot make the birthday dinner, though I will miss you. Could we look for another day to have coffee together?","I would have loved to see you, but this is not the end of the world and I understand your family plans matter. Let us check a later date rather than make you feel guilty about tonight."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
