('advanced-native-1752', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1752-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["工作紙只列日期，沒連到使用者及改變意義。"],"options":["說話者反對歷史敘述包含任何年份。","工作紙主要比較哪次改變對路程影響較大，而非列日期。","工作紙只列日期，沒連到使用者及改變意義。","工作紙已用人物故事清楚解釋每次改變。"]},"advanced-native-1752-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We were given the years without an explanation of why the events mattered.","The buildings’ users and the effects of the changes were left out.","There was no connection between the list and the neighbourhood’s experience.","It felt like a graveyard of dates because it did not connect the changes with people’s lives."],"options":["We were given the years without an explanation of why the events mattered.","The buildings’ users and the effects of the changes were left out.","There was no connection between the list and the neighbourhood’s experience.","It felt like a graveyard of dates because it did not connect the changes with people’s lives."]},"advanced-native-1752-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The dates do not make it a graveyard of dates when the account explains what the moves changed for newcomers."],"options":["The account describes only personal feelings and supplies no sequence for the club’s moves.","The dates do not make it a graveyard of dates when the account explains what the moves changed for newcomers.","The presence of years is enough to show that the report contains no meaningful connections."]},"advanced-native-1752-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["刪掉全部年份，卻仍只列互不相連的事件名字。"],"options":["刪掉全部年份，卻仍只列互不相連的事件名字。","問某個改變對當時的人有何意義。","保留必要年份，加入人物及因果連接。"]},"advanced-native-1752-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I want to avoid a graveyard of dates by explaining the connections, not by removing every useful year."],"options":["Replace each year with a longer number list before asking why any change mattered.","I want to avoid a graveyard of dates by explaining the connections, not by removing every useful year.","Keep only the event names in the same order and leave out who was affected."]},"advanced-native-1752-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The opening does feel like a graveyard of dates, but could we try the worker’s letter before giving up on the book? I would like to see how the change in hours affected family meals, not just memorise another year.","I understand why that timeline feels like a graveyard of dates without any connections. Shall we read the letter together and ask what one of those dates changed for the writer before deciding whether to continue?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
